WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Risk and reserves. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Prioritize estimate risks

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A risk register names an uncertain event, likelihood, consequence, response and owner. A reserve should trace to such risks.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Late shipping can have low part cost but high schedule impact; record both dimensions instead of one “risk score.”

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Risk register

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Prioritize estimate risks
